# Laundry App Button Hover Animation

In this task, I added a simple hover effect to the CTA button.
I added a transition on .book-btn so the effect looks smooth.
Then I used :hover with transform: scale(1.1) to make the button a little bigger.
I also added rotate(-5deg) so the button leans a bit to the left.
I checked the webpage in my browser to make sure the animation works well.